From b73329105df8f81cd9981d9e3413db39a85b0eb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <PanditRitesh@JohnDeere.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 11:29:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 002/140] fix(player): cast icon color, DPI-proof 3x3 controls
 grid, standard auto-crop switch

- Cast button now inherits the surrounding content color (drawer tiles pass
  their LocalContentColor) instead of staying fixed white, matching sibling
  controls in the More controls panel
- More controls grid: floor tile width to whole pixels so Dp rounding at
  certain densities can no longer wrap the third tile and leave a gap; the
  panel stays a fixed 3-column grid on every screen
- Aspect ratio sheet: replace the blur-thumb expressive switch in the
  auto-crop row with the standard Material 3 switch

Closes #590
---
